{"seq":2,"slug":"compensation-structure","title":"Boston Dynamics 薪酬结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/boston-dynamics/level-and-compensation/compensation-structure","wordCount":1324,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"boston-dynamics-薪酬结构\">Boston Dynamics 薪酬结构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Boston Dynamics 的薪酬结构是<strong>在波士顿地区保持研发人才竞争力、同时逐步与 Hyundai 全球框架对齐</strong>的混合体系。它的基本工资与纯软件大厂相比并不占优，但通过股权和长期激励把个人回报与公司的长周期技术目标绑定，以弥补现金薪酬上的差距。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构成部分</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本工资</td>\n<td>稳定现金收入</td>\n<td>波士顿地区上游，低于纯软件大厂顶部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年度奖金</td>\n<td>短期绩效回报</td>\n<td>与个人与团队绩效挂钩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>股权/长期激励</td>\n<td>绑定长期目标</td>\n<td>补偿现金差距，回应长周期研发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>福利</td>\n<td>综合吸引力</td>\n<td>保留研发人才的竞争力定价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>控股后逐步对齐</strong>：2021 年 Hyundai 控股后，薪酬体系向集团全球框架靠拢，但保留独立定价</li>\n<li><strong>长期激励是关键变量</strong>：对需要长周期投入的机器人研发，让人才分享长期成果是留人手段</li>\n<li><strong>与纯科技公司有结构性差异</strong>：现金薪酬偏低，靠技术影响力与长期回报补足</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"概览\">概览</h2><p>Boston Dynamics 总部位于 Massachusetts 州 Waltham，薪酬水平在波士顿地区科技公司中处于上游（但低于纯软件大厂的最高水平）。2021年被 Hyundai Motor Group 控股后，薪酬体系逐步与 Hyundai 全球框架对齐，但保留了独立的研发人才竞争力定价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"薪酬构成\">薪酬构成</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[总薪酬包] --&gt; B[基本工资&lt;br/&gt;Base Salary]&#10;    A --&gt; C[年度奖金&lt;br/&gt;Annual Bonus]&#10;    A --&gt; D[股权/长期激励&lt;br/&gt;LTI]&#10;    A --&gt; E[福利&lt;br/&gt;Benefits]\">graph LR\n    A[总薪酬包] --&gt; B[基本工资&lt;br/&gt;Base Salary]\n    A --&gt; C[年度奖金&lt;br/&gt;Annual Bonus]\n    A --&gt; D[股权/长期激励&lt;br/&gt;LTI]\n    A --&gt; E[福利&lt;br/&gt;Benefits]</pre><h3 id=\"各组成部分说明\">各组成部分说明</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>比重</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本工资</td>\n<td>固定月薪，按级别和地区定价</td>\n<td>60-75%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年度奖金</td>\n<td>基于个人+公司绩效，通常10-20%目标值</td>\n<td>10-15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期激励</td>\n<td>Hyundai RSU 或现金等价，4年Vest</td>\n<td>15-25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>福利</td>\n<td>医疗/退休金/教育补贴等</td>\n<td>非现金</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"各级别薪酬范围-2025-2026年数据\">各级别薪酬范围（2025-2026年数据）</h2><p>基于公开招聘信息和行业薪酬调查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>职位/级别</th>\n<th>基本工资范围</th>\n<th>总包预估</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Engineer（初级）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>130K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>155K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Senior Engineer</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>140</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">140K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>175K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>170</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">170K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">170</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>215K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Staff Engineer</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>170</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">170K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">170</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>210K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>210</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">210K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">210</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>270K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Principal Engineer</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>250K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>260</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">260K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">260</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>330K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Research Scientist</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>155</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">155K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">155</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>200K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>190</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">190K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">190</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>250K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sr Research Scientist</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>175</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">175K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">175</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>230K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>220</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">220K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">220</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>290K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Manager (Atlas)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>191</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">191K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">191</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>255K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>240</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">240K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">240</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>330K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Associate Director</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>178</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">178K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">178</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>230K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>230</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">230K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">230</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>300K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Director</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>193</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">193K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">193</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>240K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>260</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">260K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">260</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>330K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Senior Manager Engineering</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>177</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">177K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">177</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>220K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>220</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">220K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">220</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>290K</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hyundai-体系下的薪酬特点\">Hyundai 体系下的薪酬特点</h2><h3 id=\"与独立时期的变化\">与独立时期的变化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>独立/SoftBank 时期</th>\n<th>Hyundai 时期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>股权形式</td>\n<td>无公开股权（私有公司）</td>\n<td>Hyundai RSU 或等价现金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖金结构</td>\n<td>项目里程碑奖金</td>\n<td>标准化年度奖金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>福利体系</td>\n<td>初创公司风格</td>\n<td>大企业全套福利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调薪频率</td>\n<td>不规律</td>\n<td>年度标准调薪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退休计划</td>\n<td>基本401(k)</td>\n<td>增强版401(k) + 额外匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"hyundai-rsu-机制\">Hyundai RSU 机制</h3><p>2021年收购后，中高级员工开始获得 Hyundai Motor 股票作为长期激励：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>授予频率</strong>：年度授予</li>\n<li><strong>Vest 周期</strong>：4年，通常25%/年</li>\n<li><strong>标的</strong>：Hyundai Motor Company 股票（KRX上市）</li>\n<li><strong>特殊性</strong>：韩国股票，需了解外汇和税务影响</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"waltham-ma-地区薪酬水平定位\">Waltham, MA 地区薪酬水平定位</h2><h3 id=\"与波士顿地区其他雇主对比\">与波士顿地区其他雇主对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公司</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>Senior Engineer 薪酬</th>\n<th>vs BD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Boston Dynamics</td>\n<td>机器人</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>170</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">170K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">170</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>215K</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google (Cambridge)</td>\n<td>纯软件</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>220</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">220K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">220</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>300K</td>\n<td>+30-40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meta (Boston)</td>\n<td>纯软件</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>210</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">210K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">210</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>280K</td>\n<td>+25-35%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon Robotics</td>\n<td>机器人+物流</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">180K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>240K</td>\n<td>+5-15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iRobot</td>\n<td>消费机器人</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>130</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">130K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">130</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>170K</td>\n<td>-15-20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Medtronic</td>\n<td>医疗设备</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>140</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">140K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>180K</td>\n<td>-10-15%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"薪酬竞争力分析\">薪酬竞争力分析</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Boston Dynamics 薪酬定位] --&gt; B[vs 纯科技大厂&lt;br/&gt;低20-35%]&#10;    A --&gt; C[vs 其他机器人公司&lt;br/&gt;高10-20%]&#10;    A --&gt; D[vs 传统制造业&lt;br/&gt;高30-50%]&#10;    A --&gt; E[vs 波士顿地区中位&lt;br/&gt;高15-25%]\">graph TD\n    A[Boston Dynamics 薪酬定位] --&gt; B[vs 纯科技大厂&lt;br/&gt;低20-35%]\n    A --&gt; C[vs 其他机器人公司&lt;br/&gt;高10-20%]\n    A --&gt; D[vs 传统制造业&lt;br/&gt;高30-50%]\n    A --&gt; E[vs 波士顿地区中位&lt;br/&gt;高15-25%]</pre><p><strong>核心定位</strong>：不与 FAANG 拼现金薪酬，但通过&quot;独特技术挑战 + 稳定Hyundai支撑 + 行业影响力&quot;的组合吸引人才。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与纯科技公司的差异\">与纯科技公司的差异</h2><h3 id=\"为什么薪酬低于-faang-但仍能吸引人才\">为什么薪酬低于 FAANG 但仍能吸引人才</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异维度</th>\n<th>Boston Dynamics</th>\n<th>纯科技公司</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工作内容</td>\n<td>真实物理世界机器人</td>\n<td>软件/云服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术独特性</td>\n<td>全球唯一级别的机器人平台</td>\n<td>可替代性更高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发表自由</td>\n<td>鼓励顶会论文</td>\n<td>通常限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>职业稀缺性</td>\n<td>极少类似岗位</td>\n<td>大量可选公司</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使命感</td>\n<td>&quot;改变人类工作方式&quot;</td>\n<td>商业驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作节奏</td>\n<td>硬件节奏，非996</td>\n<td>因公司而异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"薪酬谈判的注意事项\">薪酬谈判的注意事项</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>PhD 溢价明显</strong>：有顶会论文的 PhD 可以谈到范围上限</li>\n<li><strong>稀缺技能加价</strong>：RL、运动控制、硬件设计等稀缺方向有额外空间</li>\n<li><strong>Signing Bonus</strong>：高需求岗位通常有<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20K-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>50K签约奖金</li>\n<li><strong>Relocation</strong>：从外州搬迁有搬迁包</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"福利体系\">福利体系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>医疗保险</td>\n<td>全套医疗/牙科/视力，公司承担大部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退休金</td>\n<td>401(k) + 公司匹配（通常4-6%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>教育</td>\n<td>学费报销（研究生课程相关）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假期</td>\n<td>标准PTO + 公司假期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹性工作</td>\n<td>混合办公（需现场硬件工作的除外）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>员工折扣</td>\n<td>Hyundai 集团车辆购买折扣</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Boston Dynamics 的薪酬策略可以概括为：<strong>不打薪酬最高牌，打&quot;独特机会+稳定平台+技术使命&quot;组合牌</strong>。在 Hyundai 体系下，薪酬变得更加结构化和可预测，但核心吸引力仍然是&quot;世界上极少数能做这件事的地方&quot;。对于纯薪酬最大化的候选人，FAANG 更合适；对于追求技术独特性和物理世界影响力的人才，Boston Dynamics 的总价值主张依然有竞争力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Boston Dynamics 薪酬结构","id":"boston-dynamics-薪酬结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"概览","id":"概览"},{"level":2,"text":"薪酬构成","id":"薪酬构成"},{"level":3,"text":"各组成部分说明","id":"各组成部分说明"},{"level":2,"text":"各级别薪酬范围（2025-2026年数据）","id":"各级别薪酬范围-2025-2026年数据"},{"level":2,"text":"Hyundai 体系下的薪酬特点","id":"hyundai-体系下的薪酬特点"},{"level":3,"text":"与独立时期的变化","id":"与独立时期的变化"},{"level":3,"text":"Hyundai RSU 机制","id":"hyundai-rsu-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Waltham, MA 地区薪酬水平定位","id":"waltham-ma-地区薪酬水平定位"},{"level":3,"text":"与波士顿地区其他雇主对比","id":"与波士顿地区其他雇主对比"},{"level":3,"text":"薪酬竞争力分析","id":"薪酬竞争力分析"},{"level":2,"text":"与纯科技公司的差异","id":"与纯科技公司的差异"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么薪酬低于 FAANG 但仍能吸引人才","id":"为什么薪酬低于-faang-但仍能吸引人才"},{"level":3,"text":"薪酬谈判的注意事项","id":"薪酬谈判的注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"福利体系","id":"福利体系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Boston Dynamics 职级体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/boston-dynamics/level-and-compensation/career-level-system"},"next":{"title":"Boston Dynamics 绩效考核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/boston-dynamics/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation"}}